sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor W as Admin or team member
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  actor AD as Admin
  participant C as React client
  W->>A: Any create / update / delete
  A->>D: Perform the change
  A->>D: INSERT activity log (actor name, action, module, description)
  AD->>C: Open activity log
  C->>A: GET /api/activity-logs?limit=50
  A->>A: Admin only
  A->>D: SELECT newest first
  D-->>A: entries
  A-->>C: entries
  C-->>AD: Who did what, and when
  AD->>C: Load older
  C->>A: GET /api/activity-logs?before=<last id>
